            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigaili, Daudi nguwa hhoó aán, ina gaanslár awét gawaá daanduú daqwaywose, ina xupú' dír geeraá Daudi, giti gari yaamúr ót. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigaili tina kwáhh dír ya'aá Daudi iri ó', «Aakooeé', tlaákwasíng sleémeero a daanduueé'. Na'ás, sagadiyuso'oorók iiárií qaaseek nee axweesantós iiárií qaaseek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aakooeé', daktantasír Nabali ma iiárií qaasaar, asma adoosíng umuuwós tar Nabali, an adór inós i dirii'i, asma umuú ta bay Nabali gídaabárós a daktu'uuma. Ala anír sagadiyuso'oorók daaqaywók kudá' naa ya/áp ugwa ariiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamí aakooeé', adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ slaáf ir daadeér, nee adór slafiingók i dirii'i, hamaá ga/eéra adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ dakók ngura ilaá/, marmá aga bu'ká tseerdu kiwa ku'us, nee kuúng tari dakús. Wakuuseerók maweek, nee kudá' sleémeero kuúng u ar tlaákwí sla'á', i daktana tleehhitiye' adór Nabali wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee hamí aakooeé', na'ás, qeemuueé' kwí ni koom ilaooheek daaqaywók kwisíng nee kuúng ti koomá' tir qeer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án kuúng u firiím, án gurtlawáng, aniírír sagadiyuso'oorók. Looeemaá kilae AAKOÓ MUNGÚ do'ók gu gawdees, asma kuúng aakooeé' slaqwarár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana sláqw. Qooma sleémeero baraá hotaangoge tam tlaákw ka baloó slayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes muu naa ti'iít oo slafiingók gu qwaareesár wa slaá', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwók, slafiingók gun xún dinkwa nee kudá' slafa'a, ala slafíngw wakuuseerók gun kwaahh amór saáwí ale, adoodá' hee tlaa/ano ngur tsaxaari ar kukumaayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuúng una hhooeemií tleéhh adoodá' al'axweesantós ngira oó' diroge, nee uwa tsawaár tawa waawutmoó Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng aakooeé', gár tas gurhaamut nee gár muunaáwók is slahhahhai i káhh daanduú tseerér taa tawo ku'usi as marmá kawa bú'. Ala aakooeé' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ bál bura hhooeemií tleéhh, na'ás, aníng islawáng anír sagadiyuso'oorók.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi Abigaili gari báy, «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguú múk Israeli i xirfuuti, kudá' kiíng iga ya/aaw laarí, án nee kiíng tiwa doogaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú kiíng i tsuuqi, nee sagalooarók tisíng ngi tsuuqi, asma iwa ila/ niwa dahiiká baraá dakuúsár tseerdu ngiwa ku'uus, as marmá ngiwa buu' ar dakw'eé' oo kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ar loe, adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli ir daadeér, inós bar aníng iga har'oohiiká, kiíng iwa hariiaw, geeraawo barnaxes na gaanslár hardatká án nee kiíng tiwa doogaan, geera matlaatlér matloowo hhawaatmo i kaahh doó Nabaliwo.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi muruudá' sleémeero Abigaili i koon guri óh, gari báy, «Kiíng waátl amór do'ók ar wayda, ga/aaweek tidá' kiíng naa aníng beér aga axaás, nee firoorók aga ilaóh.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigaili iri wátl amór do', iwa hardát dír do'ose Nabali taa amohhe'eés muruú /aymár úr gwaa tleéhh oo hariímár doó waawutmoó wa ale, Nabali a kuqá' yaanda hhoó', asma aa qaroó ooniít. Gawaá adoorihe gár ngwaa beér i káhh tam ar wák, ay matlaatle iimi iwa /awaakuúr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigaili matlaatleero hhawaatuuwós nguwa aán naxés oonitamedár difaái aa fák, kangwdá' sleémeero guri dirós alki/ít. Tawa didár kilá' i kahhi Nabali ina tawoó sol'omiít iri tsaúy, tari adór tlaa/ano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá deelo mibaangw iwa waaráhh, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Nabali guri slaáhh iri gwaá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ngiwa axaás adór Nabali ira gwaá', iri oó', «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i xirfuuti kudá' marmaádá' gaa buu' dír Nabali, as aníng iwa /oosliislín. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng iga pa/ás gár tlaakw ngiwa tleehh. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ marmá gana buú' gawaá Nabali as tlakweemaawós.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá kaangwí iwa hhooáy Daudi muu guna ya/aáw amór Abigaili kawa lehhtuú ay as Daudi, asma gaa waatlakweés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagadiyuusér Daudi tawa hardáh dír Abigaili amoodár Karmeli, kari báy, «Daudi atén taa ya/aáw as kiíng iwa aayór dó' wa slai.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigaili ina sihhít dír geeraaín, gitse/aawós gay yaamúr ót, iri ó', «Qaytsiít, aníng a sagadiyuso'ór tawo, aníng ti amohhoó', ya'aá sagadiyuusér aakooeé' ngiwa hamaatl.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigaili ina gaanslút, ina sihhít, iri gaanslár tsa/aán gawaá daqwaywós, tari alkoné' nee sagadiyuuseerós ar /ameena ar kooán, tari altláy nee sagadiyuusér Daudi, inós gari duúx.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám Daudi Ahinoamu ar Yesre'eli gana duúx, kuká' tsaraawo tari tlaawoó Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Saulo dasiirós tidá' ta bay Mikali, tidá' Daudi aa duúx, gana haniís dír Palti garmoó Laishi, heé yaamaá Galimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
